      "direction": "changed",
      "relativeTo": "nvidia.llama-3-3-nemotron-super-49b-v1-5",
      "text": "Uses a hybrid Mamba-Transformer latent mixture-of-experts design with multi-token prediction, activating 12B of its 120B parameters per token.",
