  "notes": "NVIDIA writes the name with its company prefix (NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Super); the record name leaves it out. The API id nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b is the build.nvidia.com model path linked from the model card. Release date: the launch post and the model card say March 11, 2026; the research page shows March 10, 2026 (kept as an alternative); the Hugging Face repositories were created on 2026-03-10. The released size (120B total, 12B active) differs from the approximate size in the December 2025 announcement (about 100B, up to 10B active). The research page also lists Qwen3-Nemotron-235B-A22B-GenRM-2603 as the reward model used for RLHF; it is not a variant. A separate MTPv2 speculative decoding checkpoint (Nemotron-3-Super-120B-A12B-BF16-MTPv2) is not recorded as a variant. Technical report: https://research.nvidia.com/labs/nemotron/files/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Super-Technical-Report.pdf."
